          <p>However, the <code>managementState</code> of the Image Registry Operator alters the behavior of the deployed image pruner job:</p>
          <ul>
          <li><code>Managed</code>: the <code>--prune-registry</code> flag for the image pruner is set to <code>true</code>.</li>
          <li><code>Removed</code>: the <code>--prune-registry</code> flag for the image pruner is set to <code>false</code>, meaning it only prunes image metadata in etcd.</li>
          </ul>
